#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:26
msgid "Working with Floating IPs"
msgstr "Working con IPs flotantes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:28
msgid ""
"When provisioning to supported Clouds, |morpheus| will give the option to"
" attach a floating IP at provision time. From the CONFIGURE tab of the "
"provisioning wizard for supported Clouds, select the desired floating IP."
msgstr ""
"Cuando provisioning a soportado Nubes, |morpheus| será dar el opción a "
"attach un floating IP en provision tiempo. Desde el CONFIGURE pestaña del"
" provisioning wizard para soportado Nubes, seleccionar el desired "
"floating IP."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/infrastructure/network/floatIpSet.png"
msgstr ".. imagen:: imágenes/infrastructure/network/floatIpSet.png"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/floating_ips.rst:32
msgid ""
"During Instance teardown, |morpheus| gives the option to release the "
"floating IP."
msgstr ""
"Durante Instancia teardown, |morpheus| da el opción a release el floating"
" IP."

